σ vs ensemble spread — arm D, ablation synthetic (single run, seed TRAIN=2026)
WORK = tmp_ablation
nmembers = 5

DEFINITIONS
  bundle.sigma  = sqrt( mean_k(σ_k^2) + var_k(μ_k) )   # combined (aleatoric + epistemic)
  aleatoric     = sqrt( mean_k(σ_k^2) )                # network σ head, ensemble-mean
  bundle.spread = sqrt( var_k(μ_k) )                   # empirical μ disagreement
  PriorBundle.spread was populated by prior_from_ensemble (not nothing).
  ablation_prior_2d.jl previously never called write_prior, so .std was not on disk.

